<title>USA: Fusion Systems to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Fusion Systems to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fusion Systems Corp said Wednesday after the market closed that its board of directors has approved the repurchase of up to $20 million of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Fusion has about 7.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
